```
VAR Left : CTD; END_VAR
Left(CD := PartRemoved, LD := NewBatch, PV := 10);
BatchEmpty := Left.Q;
```
Counting down remaining parts in a batch or remaining attempts before a lockout works this way. Load the preset first: a CTD that was never loaded starts at CV = 0, so Q is already TRUE.

